# This PC has core.autocrlf=true, so say plainly what is binary and what is text. Git's own
# guess is right today (the .gz blobs commit byte-identical), but these files are written
# unattended all season and the cloud side has to be able to gunzip and json.load every one.
*.json.gz binary
*.json    text eol=lf
*.py      text eol=lf
*.md      text eol=lf
